WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.202 --> 00:00:02.942
- Alright, we are on our
way to Cider House 101.

00:00:02.942 --> 00:00:04.532
Our good friend, Mark, is going to

00:00:04.532 --> 00:00:05.545
have us along for this ride.

00:00:05.545 --> 00:00:07.906
He's gonna show us a fresh-pressed juice,

00:00:07.906 --> 00:00:10.147
and a fermented juice.
- [Voiceover] What up, Mark?

00:00:10.147 --> 00:00:12.584
- [Voiceover] I wore my
autumn shirt in preparation.

00:00:12.584 --> 00:00:13.641
- I wore my fall hair.

00:00:13.641 --> 00:00:14.941
- Oh, wait. That's right.

00:00:14.941 --> 00:00:16.427
Never touch a black woman's hair.

00:00:16.427 --> 00:00:17.483
That's how I lost this finger.

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:19.819
(laughter)

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.869
(whimsical music)

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:24.287
- [Voiceover] I am the
founder of 101 Cider House.

00:00:24.287 --> 00:00:25.924
At heart, really what I am is a cider guy,

00:00:25.924 --> 00:00:27.178
trying to convert people,

00:00:27.178 --> 00:00:28.583
thinking that it's just this ridiculous,

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:30.823
sweet, alcho, pop-like substance

00:00:30.823 --> 00:00:31.903
that sorority girls are drinking

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:32.959
on a Friday night somewhere,

00:00:32.959 --> 00:00:34.306
waking up with a raging hangover.

00:00:34.306 --> 00:00:36.256
- Exactly. That's what I thought.

00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:38.328
- So, cider isn't just beer for weanies?

00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:40.092
- No, and actually
cider is more like wine.

00:00:40.092 --> 00:00:40.965
It's apple wine.

00:00:40.965 --> 00:00:42.613
- Can you do it with bananas?

00:00:42.613 --> 00:00:43.100
- [Man in red shirt] No.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:43.963
- Let's go inside, alright?

00:00:43.963 --> 00:00:44.961
It's just too much talking.

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:47.937
- Hey, wait. Let's go in-cider.

00:00:47.937 --> 00:00:49.516
- [Voiceover] In here is
our fresh-pressed juice.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.513
There's yeast contained in the juice

00:00:51.513 --> 00:00:52.952
that comes off the orchards.

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:54.810
We don't sterilize it,
we don't pasteurize it.

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.133
We put it right into the tank,

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:57.689
and we let it do its own thing naturally.

00:00:57.689 --> 00:00:59.143
- This not boozy.

00:00:59.143 --> 00:01:00.016
- No.

00:01:00.016 --> 00:01:01.173
- [Female] Oh.
- [Male in cap] Ah!

00:01:01.173 --> 00:01:02.136
- [Man in white shirt] That's so good!

00:01:02.136 --> 00:01:02.772
- [Female] So good.

00:01:02.772 --> 00:01:04.306
- [Male in cap] Why don't
I drink more apple juice?

00:01:04.306 --> 00:01:05.203
- [Voiceover] When you
get it from the grocery

00:01:05.203 --> 00:01:08.465
store, it tastes fake
but this is pure apples.

00:01:08.465 --> 00:01:10.264
- And, when it's cloudy, when it's cloudy,

00:01:10.264 --> 00:01:11.185
you know, that's when it's good.

00:01:11.185 --> 00:01:11.793
- [Female] Whoa!

00:01:11.793 --> 00:01:12.738
- [Voiceover] That's
what's going on right here.

00:01:12.738 --> 00:01:14.491
- [Voiceover] This is
cider, that's a cider snake.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:16.313
All that goes in that barrel is juice.

00:01:16.313 --> 00:01:18.090
It's really cool, if you
watch inside the tank

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:19.912
a week from now, it's got its own current.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:21.607
- Well, I think we're
about to drink some cider.

00:01:21.607 --> 00:01:23.260
- (singing) I want me some cider,

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:24.788
I want me some cider.

00:01:24.788 --> 00:01:26.065
- When it's all finished product,

00:01:26.065 --> 00:01:27.249
we bring it into the tasting room.

00:01:27.249 --> 00:01:29.129
Cider is actually a culinary-driven

00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:29.979
type of experience.

00:01:29.979 --> 00:01:31.291
You want to pair it well with food.

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:31.811
- That is some...

00:01:31.811 --> 00:01:32.450
(bottle cap popping)

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:33.128
- [Female] Whoo!

00:01:33.128 --> 00:01:34.451
- This is our India pale cider.

00:01:34.451 --> 00:01:35.670
So, this is a hops cider.

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:36.692
- [Voiceover] Did a lot of dry-hopping

00:01:36.692 --> 00:01:38.027
in middle school.
(laughter)

00:01:38.027 --> 00:01:39.164
- [Female} I can't.

00:01:39.164 --> 00:01:40.221
- Cheers.
(glasses clinking)

00:01:40.221 --> 00:01:42.281
- It's kosher. It's vegan-friendly.

00:01:42.281 --> 00:01:43.826
This is 100% gluten-free.

00:01:43.826 --> 00:01:46.926
It is 100% raw, probiotic, unfiltered,

00:01:46.926 --> 00:01:49.341
unpasteurized, and it's
naturally sparkling.

00:01:49.341 --> 00:01:50.745
An unripened goat cheese goes

00:01:50.745 --> 00:01:52.417
very well with this hop cider.

00:01:52.417 --> 00:01:53.880
- So, should I do like sip, bite?

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.203
- Swish the cider around in your mouth,

00:01:55.203 --> 00:01:56.364
and mix it with the cheese.

00:01:56.364 --> 00:01:57.096
- [Voiceover] Oh, yeah.

00:01:57.096 --> 00:01:58.582
- l love this cheese.
- [Man in cap] Mmhm.

00:01:58.582 --> 00:01:59.774
- I don't know much about pairing,

00:01:59.774 --> 00:02:01.623
I show up to work with,
like, blue pants and blue

00:02:01.623 --> 00:02:03.155
shirt and Freddy is
like, what are you doing?

00:02:03.155 --> 00:02:03.883
(laughter)

00:02:03.883 --> 00:02:04.914
- [Voiceover] This is going to be our

00:02:04.914 --> 00:02:05.998
Cactus Red cocktail.

00:02:05.998 --> 00:02:09.141
Campari, classic liqueur from Italy.

00:02:09.141 --> 00:02:09.803
I just take one bottle.

00:02:09.803 --> 00:02:10.697
- [Female] Steve, you drunk?

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:11.974
- I'm getting drunk, watching this.

00:02:11.974 --> 00:02:13.959
- [Voiceover] Now, we take this Campari,

00:02:13.959 --> 00:02:16.507
I'm just gonna stir it up a little bit.

00:02:16.507 --> 00:02:18.235
You're taking an old-school
beverage like cider

00:02:18.235 --> 00:02:19.556
then you're giving it a whole new spin

00:02:19.556 --> 00:02:20.810
and making it craft cider.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:21.314
(glasses clinking)

00:02:21.314 --> 00:02:23.222
- (in unison) Cheers.
- Cheers.

00:02:23.222 --> 00:02:24.441
- [Voiceover] Oh, okay.
I can drink a thousand.

00:02:24.441 --> 00:02:25.207
- [Female] Oh, yeah.

00:02:25.207 --> 00:02:25.868
- It's dangerous.

00:02:25.868 --> 00:02:27.262
- I wanna be drinking this at a pool

00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:28.562
in Palm Springs when it's a hundred

00:02:28.562 --> 00:02:29.641
and fourteen degrees.

00:02:29.641 --> 00:02:30.466
- Absolutely.

00:02:30.466 --> 00:02:31.429
- Yeah, this is more refreshing

00:02:31.429 --> 00:02:32.028
than a glass of water.

00:02:32.028 --> 00:02:33.351
- We're gonna go to the official

00:02:33.351 --> 00:02:35.685
tasting room over there.

00:02:35.685 --> 00:02:36.532
- [Voiceover] The VIP.

00:02:36.532 --> 00:02:37.832
- [Voiceover] Grab a
bite of that manchego.

00:02:37.832 --> 00:02:38.831
- [Voiceover] Yeah, it smells funky.

00:02:38.831 --> 00:02:40.412
- [Voiceover] Cheers.
(glasses clinking)

00:02:40.412 --> 00:02:41.776
- Well, it tastes like kombucha.

00:02:41.776 --> 00:02:43.076
It does not taste like it smells.

00:02:43.076 --> 00:02:44.237
It definitely smells like a wet dog,

00:02:44.237 --> 00:02:45.259
but it tastes delicious.

00:02:45.259 --> 00:02:46.513
- [Voiceover] The more
I'm drinking on this...

00:02:46.513 --> 00:02:47.349
- It grows on you, man.

00:02:47.349 --> 00:02:48.034
- [Voiceover] It's getting on me.

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:48.859
I feel sophisticated.

00:02:48.859 --> 00:02:49.973
- [Voiceover] Triple funky white wine.

00:02:49.973 --> 00:02:51.181
- [Voiceover] Alright.
Last one, Black Dog.

00:02:51.181 --> 00:02:52.655
You gotta head out to the bar.
- [Voiceover] Black dog.

00:02:52.655 --> 00:02:53.712
- [Voiceover] Are you gonna open this one?

00:02:53.712 --> 00:02:54.373
- [Voiceover] Yeah, I'll open it.

00:02:54.373 --> 00:02:55.153
- [Voiceover] Can I open it?

00:02:55.153 --> 00:02:56.318
- [Voiceover] Now, drop your hand down

00:02:56.318 --> 00:02:57.607
and it hold it like a trigger.

00:02:57.607 --> 00:02:58.849
And, then watch that mist.

00:02:58.849 --> 00:02:59.862
- (in unison) Ooh.
- Now, watch your hand.

00:02:59.862 --> 00:03:01.107
There you go.

00:03:01.107 --> 00:03:02.407
- Oh, yeah.

00:03:02.407 --> 00:03:03.684
Do I look cool like this?

00:03:03.684 --> 00:03:04.628
- You look super cool.

00:03:04.628 --> 00:03:05.492
- [Voiceover] Now that
we've already popped it,

00:03:05.492 --> 00:03:06.753
let's rock it.

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:09.005
Black Dog, it's like a
creamy, black lemonade.

00:03:09.005 --> 00:03:10.650
- [Voiceover] Whoa.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:11.538
- [Female] Intense.

00:03:11.538 --> 00:03:12.116
- That's special.

00:03:12.116 --> 00:03:13.431
It tastes fresh.

00:03:13.431 --> 00:03:15.368
- The thing is, you
make fresh-pressed juice

00:03:15.368 --> 00:03:17.470
and you ferment it and
it just gets better.

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:18.689
- Who get turnt at the juice bar?

00:03:18.689 --> 00:03:19.385
- I tell you what.

00:03:19.385 --> 00:03:21.382
You can drink this with
food, without food.

00:03:21.382 --> 00:03:22.705
Cold or hot.

00:03:22.705 --> 00:03:23.808
You can have different fruit flavors,

00:03:23.808 --> 00:03:24.725
you can add hops.

00:03:24.725 --> 00:03:25.770
You can do anything you want to it.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:27.523
It's the most diverse
beverage on the planet.

00:03:27.523 --> 00:03:28.382
- [Voiceover] Usually in this situation,

00:03:28.382 --> 00:03:31.031
I'd give you a handshake
to wrap up the video,

00:03:31.031 --> 00:03:33.246
but I'm a little tossed
so I think it's hug time.

00:03:33.246 --> 00:03:35.208
(laughter)

00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:37.207
- [Voiceover] I'm getting out of here.

00:03:37.207 --> 00:03:38.591
No! Help me, Freddy.

00:03:38.591 --> 00:03:39.729
- [Voiceover] Come on in, Freddy.

00:03:39.729 --> 00:03:41.159
(laughter)

00:03:41.159 --> 00:03:43.920
- Yeah. There we go.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:44.616
- That's hilarious.

00:03:44.616 --> 00:03:46.862
- I hate hugs.
(laughter)

00:03:46.862 --> 00:03:48.325
- Hi.

00:03:48.325 --> 00:03:50.674
- Oh, hey guys.

00:03:50.674 --> 00:03:51.544
- (in unison) Sarah.

00:03:51.544 --> 00:03:52.774
- Up here.

00:03:52.774 --> 00:03:53.424
- We made a series.

00:03:53.424 --> 00:03:54.933
- It's coming on November 18th.

00:03:54.933 --> 00:03:56.176
- Please watch it.

00:03:56.176 --> 00:03:57.162
- Get it here.

00:03:57.162 --> 00:03:57.925
- Over here.
- (in unison) There, there,

00:03:57.925 --> 00:03:58.812
there, over there.

00:03:58.812 --> 00:04:00.313
- You got it. I think they got it.

00:04:00.313 --> 00:04:01.290
- Okay, I'm out.
- Yeah, they got it. Bye.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.496
- If you look in the
area then you can see it.

00:04:02.496 --> 00:04:05.103
It'll be released 2015, November.

00:04:05.103 --> 00:04:06.944
(indistinct yelling)
- Okay.

